// App.xcconfig — base build settings for the WantProcuration target (committed).
//
// APP_SIGNING_SECRET signs every POST /chat to the AI Gateway (IOS_PORT_GUIDE.md §4.10).
// Do NOT put the real secret here. Put it in Config/Secrets.xcconfig (ignored by git):
//     APP_SIGNING_SECRET = the-secret-from-the-gateway-team
// Without it the app still works, but the gateway gives this device fewer smart replies per day.
// Note: in .xcconfig files "//" starts a comment, so the secret must not contain "//".

APP_SIGNING_SECRET =

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
